# atlas-devtools — developer CLIs that DO have an ebuild.
#
# Source of truth for the portage section of phases/32-devtools.sh. That phase
# installs from four different places (portage, npm, uv, upstream installers);
# only what is listed here comes from portage, and only this part can be a
# depclean root. The npm/uv/curl tools are unmanaged by portage and unaffected
# by the package-sets model.
#
# Both GURU packages need a keyword line (GURU never stabilises anything);
# awscli-bin over awscli deliberately — the source build drags in a large
# python dependency set to produce the same binary.

dev-util/stripe-cli
app-admin/awscli-bin

# GURU — API client, the Electron repack
dev-util/bruno-bin

# Containers. Undeclared until 2026-07-26 despite docker being enabled in
# the default runlevel and $USER being in the docker group, which had also been
# added by hand rather than by any phase here.
# docker-cli is a separate package from the daemon; docker-compose is the v2
# plugin, not the old python script.
app-containers/docker
app-containers/docker-cli
app-containers/docker-compose
